                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  WXTR3800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  STEFANO GIOBBI                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  970322                                                *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PROGRAMMET INGÅR I VCAS UPPFÖLJNINGSMILJÖ.            *        
*                PROGRAMMET SLÅR SKAPAR VECKOFIL MED PACKAT-           *        
*                HISTORIK.                                             *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    FILE SECTION                                *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
FILE WXTR38D1                                                                   
*     PACKFIL                                                                   
   IN-IDDC            1    2  A                                                 
   IN-IDPRC           *    4  A                                                 
   IN-KDORDKL         *    1  N 0                                               
   IN-IDDISTR         *    4  N 0                                               
   IN-PACKED-AVG      *   10  P 2                                               
   IN-VKARTNTO        *   10  P 3                                               
   IN-VLARTNTO        *   10  P 1                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE WXTR38D2   FB (41 0)                                                       
*     VECKOFIL PACKAT                                                           
   UT-IDDC            1    2  A                                                 
   UT-IDPRC           *    4  A                                                 
   UT-KDORDKL         *    1  N 0                                               
   UT-IDDISTR         *    4  N 0                                               
   UT-PACKED-AVG      *   10  P 2                                               
   UT-VKARTNTO        *   10  P 3                                               
   UT-VLARTNTO        *   10  P 1                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
  JA                        W   1  A   VALUE 'J'                                
  NEJ                       W   1  A   VALUE 'N'                                
*                                                                               
  W-PACKED-AVG              W   10  P 2                                         
  W-VKARTNTO                W   10  P 3                                         
  W-VLARTNTO                W   10  P 1                                         
  SPAR-IDDC                 W    2  A                                           
  SPAR-IDPRC                W    4  A                                           
  SPAR-KDORDKL              W    1  P                                           
  SPAR-IDDISTR              W    3  P 0                                         
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    JOB SECTION                                 *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
  JOB INPUT WXTR38D1     FINISH S01-SKRIV-VECKOFIL                              
                                                                                
     IF RECORD-COUNT       =  1                                                 
        SPAR-IDDC          =  IN-IDDC                                           
        SPAR-IDPRC         =  IN-IDPRC                                          
        SPAR-KDORDKL       =  IN-KDORDKL                                        
        SPAR-IDDISTR       =  IN-IDDISTR                                        
        W-PACKED-AVG       =  0                                                 
        W-VKARTNTO         =  0                                                 
        W-VLARTNTO         =  0                                                 
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF  SPAR-IDDC     = IN-IDDC    AND                          +              
         SPAR-IDPRC    = IN-IDPRC   AND                          +              
         SPAR-KDORDKL  = IN-KDORDKL AND                          +              
         SPAR-IDDISTR  = IN-IDDISTR                                             
       W-PACKED-AVG  = W-PACKED-AVG + IN-PACKED-AVG                             
       W-VLARTNTO    = W-VLARTNTO   + IN-VLARTNTO                               
       W-VKARTNTO    = W-VKARTNTO   + IN-VKARTNTO                               
     ELSE                                                                       
                                                                                
       PERFORM S01-SKRIV-VECKOFIL                                               
                                                                                
       W-PACKED-AVG  = IN-PACKED-AVG                                            
       W-VLARTNTO    = IN-VLARTNTO                                              
       W-VKARTNTO    = IN-VKARTNTO                                              
       SPAR-IDDC     = IN-IDDC                                                  
       SPAR-IDPRC    = IN-IDPRC                                                 
       SPAR-KDORDKL  = IN-KDORDKL                                               
       SPAR-IDDISTR  = IN-IDDISTR                                               
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
  NEWPAGE                                                                       
                                                                                
  S01-SKRIV-VECKOFIL. PROC                                                      
                                                                                
     UT-IDDC        = SPAR-IDDC                                                 
     UT-IDPRC       = SPAR-IDPRC                                                
     UT-KDORDKL     = SPAR-KDORDKL                                              
     UT-IDDISTR     = SPAR-IDDISTR                                              
     UT-PACKED-AVG  = W-PACKED-AVG                                              
     UT-VLARTNTO    = W-VLARTNTO                                                
     UT-VKARTNTO    = W-VKARTNTO                                                
                                                                                
     PUT WXTR38D2                                                               
                                                                                
  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
